        "text_iGk88p": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Creative teams looking for an idea that would become the I LOVE NY for Miami. The icon of the Magic City. After some initial proposals, the I AM MIAMI idea came and we all agreed that it was a big idea. Nobody has realized that the center letters of Miami say I AM! How is that possible? It's obvious when you see it and then it remains forever stuck in your mind. We explored different fonts, different colors, different shapes, and different ways to bring the big idea to life until we ‘got it. Yes, we got it!</p>",
